## Update Text Syntax

  send bgp <selector> update text [attributes] nlri <action> <prefix>...           (IPv4 unicast)
  send bgp <selector> update text [attributes] mp <family> <action> <nlri>...    (MP_REACH/MP_UNREACH)

  Selectors:  * (all), <ip-address>, <peer-name>
  Actions:    add <prefix>, del <prefix>, eor

  Attributes (common):
    origin <igp|egp|incomplete>
    next-hop <ip-address>             (alias: nhop)
    local-preference <N>
    med <N>
    as-path [<asn> ...]
    community <value>                 (e.g. 65000:100, no-export)
    large-community <value>           (e.g. 65000:100:200)
    extended-community <value>

  Attributes (family-specific):
    path-id <N>                       (ADD-PATH path identifier)
    rd <value>                        (Route Distinguisher for VPN)
    label <N>                         (MPLS label for labeled/VPN)

  Example:
    send bgp * update text origin igp next-hop 1.1.1.1 local-preference 100 nlri add 10.0.0.0/24

