## Plugins

  anomaly-detect           Behavioral anomaly detector (report-only): per-entity pattern-of-life over trafficfeature
  anomaly-observe          Behavioral anomaly observability: incident lifecycle store and show anomaly observe CLI
  anomaly-shape            Shadow-first autonomous anomaly responder: per-source rate-limit with arm/auto-revert/kill-switch
  as112                    AS112 anycast DNS node: authoritative sink for misdirected RFC 1918 / link-local reverse-DNS queries (RFC 7534, RFC 7535)
  bfd                      Bidirectional Forwarding Detection (RFC 5880, 5881, 5883)
    RFCs: 5880, 5881, 5882, 5883
  bgp                      BGP routing daemon
  bgp-adj-rib-in           Adj-RIB-In storage (raw hex replay)
    RFCs: 4271
  bgp-aigp                 Accumulated IGP Metric (RFC 7311)
    RFCs: 7311
  bgp-bmp                  BMP receiver and sender (RFC 7854, 8671)
    RFCs: 7854, 8671
  bgp-capa                 Core BGP capability decoding (multiprotocol, asn4, add-path, paths-limit, extended-nexthop, extended-message)
    RFCs: 4760, 6793, 7911, 8654, 8950, draft-abraitis-idr-addpath-paths-limit
  bgp-epe                  Native BGP Egress Peer Engineering segments
    RFCs: 9086
  bgp-filter-aspath        Named AS-path regex filter (ordered entries, first match wins, accept/reject)
  bgp-filter-aspath-length Named AS-path length filter (accept/reject based on hop count)
  bgp-filter-community     Community tag/strip filter (standard, large, extended)
  bgp-filter-community-match Named community match filter (ordered entries, first match wins, accept/reject)
  bgp-filter-family        Named address-family policy filter: remove a family's NLRI or tear down the session
  bgp-filter-irr           IRR-based prefix-list filter for eBGP peers
  bgp-filter-modify        Named route attribute modifier (set local-preference, med, origin, next-hop)
  bgp-filter-path-asn      Named reject-asn list: rejects a route whose AS_PATH carries a listed ASN at a listed position
  bgp-filter-prefix        Named prefix-list filter (CIDR + ge/le + accept/reject)
  bgp-filter-remove-private-as Named AS-path action filter that removes RFC 6996 Private Use ASNs
  bgp-gr                   Graceful Restart capability and mechanism plugin
    RFCs: 4724, 9494
  bgp-healthcheck          Service healthcheck plugin with watchdog route control
  bgp-hostname             FQDN capability decoding
    RFCs: draft-walton-bgp-hostname-capability
  bgp-llnh                 Link-Local Next-Hop capability plugin
